    "sections": {
        "description": "The Property Broker Theme is a sophisticated and professional solution crafted specifically for the real estate industry, ideal for real estate brokers, agents, consultants, developers, and property managers. Designed to help professionals showcase real estate listings, it supports a wide range of sectors including residential, commercial, industrial, and rental properties. Whether you’re promoting luxury homes, vacation rentals, condos for sale, apartments, villas, or multifamily real estate, this theme offers a powerful and user-friendly platform for presenting properties and services. Built with a real estate plugin for seamless customization and drag-and-drop editing, it allows complete design flexibility without coding. With its elegant layout, clean typography, and modern design, the theme ensures your property website is both visually appealing and highly functional. It comes with advanced features like property search filters, Google Maps integration, listing galleries, virtual tour support, mortgage calculator, lead capture forms, and CTA buttons to maximize real estate leads. Optimized for mobile responsiveness and real estate SEO, and compatible with IDX/MLS integration, it’s perfect for property listing websites, real estate agencies, investment portfolios, smart homes, and real estate marketing platforms. https://preview.mizanthemes.com/property-broker/"
    },
